                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                           <td>The patient’s estimated glomerular filtration rate (eGFR) is mildly decreased (62 mL/min/1.73 m²), indicating stage 2-3a chronic kidney disease. This may reflect age-related decline or early renal impairment. Clinical correlation and monitoring of renal function over time are recommended.</td>
